                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S \subset Mor(\mathcal{D})
              is a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/set"} set
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/morphisms"} morphisms
              such that
            %ol
              %li
                %p
                  the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bousfield+localization+of+model+categories"} left Bousfield localization
                  of
