          %h2#references References
          %p
            See the references at
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+category"} model category
          %ul#Hirschhorn
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Philip+Hirschhorn"}> Philip Hirschhorn
              ,
              %em Model categories and their localization
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+May"}> Peter May
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kate+Ponto"} Kate Ponto
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/More+concise+algebraic+topology"} More concise algebraic topology
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://press.uchicago.edu/ucp/books/book/chicago/M/bo12322308.html"} ISBN:9780226511795
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.math.uchicago.edu/~may/TEAK/KateBookFinal.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            The proof that a Quillen adjunction of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+categories"} model categories
            induces an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjunction+of+%28infinity%2C1%29-categories"} adjunction of (infinity,1)-categories
            is recorded in
          %ul
            %li#MazelGee16
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Aaron+Mazel-Gee"}> Aaron Mazel-Gee
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Quillen adjunctions induce adjunctions of quasicategories
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1501.03146"} arXiv:1501.03146
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://nyjm.albany.edu/j/2016/22-4.html"} publisher
          %p and this question is also partially addressed in
          %ul
            %li#Hinich14
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vladimir+Hinich"}> Vladimir Hinich
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Dwyer-Kan Localization Revisited
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1311.4128"} arXiv:1311.4128
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://dx.doi.org/10.4310/HHA.2016.v18.n1.a3"} doi:10.4310/HHA.2016.v18.n1.a3
          %p
            The case for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/simplicial+model+categories"} simplicial model categories
            is also in
          %ul
            %li#Lurie
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacob+Lurie"}> Jacob Lurie
              ,
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Higher+Topos+Theory"} Higher Topos Theory
